---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { contact, hrefs } from "../config/site";

/* ============================================================
   JVG SHIPPING PROCESS — customer instruction page.
   noIndex: this is a hand-out link Joe texts/emails to sellers,
   not a page meant to be found in search (matches live's
   "noindex, follow"). Deliberately NOT listed on /sitemap/ and
   not linked from nav. If @astrojs/sitemap is ever added,
   exclude /jvg-shipping-process/ there too.

   The FedEx account number and the Fraser Drive shipping address
   are operational facts — keep them EXACTLY as on the live page.
   (The shipping address differs from the site-config contact
   address on purpose; do not swap in contact.address.)

   Copy is deliberately short: sellers read this on a phone, often
   standing in a FedEx parking lot. Every fact from the longer
   original is still here, just in fewer words. Don't pad it back
   out.
   ============================================================ */

const SHIP_TO = "47 North Fraser Drive East, Mesa, AZ 85203";
const FEDEX_ACCT = "541950800";
---

<Layout
  title="JVG Shipping Process"
  description="Step-by-step instructions for shipping your guitar to Joe's Vintage Guitars: free packing and shipping on my FedEx account, full insurance, and payment before you leave the counter."
  canonical="/jvg-shipping-process/"
  noIndex={true}
>
  <section class="ship-title-bar">
    <div class="ship-inner"><h1>JVG Shipping Process</h1></div>
  </section>

  <section class="ship-body">
    <div class="ship-inner">
      <p class="ship-lede">
        Shipping me your guitar from out of state is simple and secure, and you’ll have your payment
        before you even leave the FedEx counter. Five steps, and your part is done.
      </p>

      <div class="ship-reviews">
        <p class="ship-reviews__lead">Hundreds of sellers have already done this.</p>
        <p>Click below to read reviews from people who sold me a guitar using this same process.</p>
        <a
          class="ship-reviews__btn"
          href={hrefs.googleReviews}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Read Reviews From People Who Sold Me Their Guitar
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="ship-callout">
        <ul>
          <li><strong>You pay nothing.</strong> Packing and shipping both go on my FedEx account.</li>
          <li><strong>Fully insured</strong> the whole way, under our private musical instrument policy.</li>
          <li><strong>Paid at the counter.</strong> Text me the FedEx receipt and your payment goes out.</li>
          <li><strong>I’m on text the whole time.</strong> Anything unclear, message me at <a href={hrefs.sms}>{contact.phone}</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h2><span class="ship-step">Step 1</span> Send Me Your Info</h2>
      <p>
        Text or email me your preferred email address and a photo of your driver’s license. The license
        photo is strictly for fraud prevention; it confirms the sale on both sides. If you’d rather not
        send it, that’s fine. I’ll simply send payment after the guitar arrives and is verified instead
        of at the counter.
      </p>

      <h2><span class="ship-step">Step 2</span> Pack the Inside of the Case</h2>
      <p>
        Fill every empty space in the case so the guitar can’t move at all. Newspaper, old t-shirts,
        towels, paper towels, and foam all work. Then close the case and shake it hard in every
        direction. Hear or feel anything shift? Add more padding.
      </p>
      <div class="ship-warn">
        <strong>No bubble wrap inside the case.</strong> It can react with the nitrocellulose lacquer on
        vintage finishes and leave permanent marks. Soft cloth, newspaper, and paper towels are all
        safe. Bubble wrap outside the case is fine, just never touching the guitar.
      </div>

      <h2><span class="ship-step">Step 3</span> Take It to FedEx</h2>
      <div class="ship-exact">
        <p class="ship-exact__label">It has to be this, word for word:</p>
        <p class="ship-exact__name">FedEx Office Print &amp; Ship Center</p>
        <p class="ship-exact__note">
          If the sign on the building says anything else, it is the wrong place. A
          “FedEx Authorized ShipCenter,” a plain “FedEx Ship Center,” or any pack-and-ship store with
          a FedEx sign in the window is a different business and cannot do this. Not sure? Text me the
          name before you hand over the guitar.
        </p>
      </div>
      <p>
        Call ahead and ask whether they have a guitar box in stock. Phone tip: when the automated menu
        picks up, press 7 to go straight through to a person at that location.
      </p>

      <h2><span class="ship-step">Step 4</span> At the Counter</h2>
      <p>
        Text me a photo of the guitar on the counter. Then hand it to the FedEx employee, ask them to
        pack it very tightly, and give them this:
      </p>
      <table class="ship-table">
        <tbody>
          <tr><th>FedEx Account #</th><td>{FEDEX_ACCT}</td></tr>
          <tr><th>Charge to Account</th><td>Packaging + Shipping (you pay nothing)</td></tr>
          <tr><th>Ship To</th><td>{SHIP_TO}</td></tr>
          <tr><th>Shipping Speed</th><td>Cheapest option, unless I’ve told you otherwise</td></tr>
          <tr><th>Insurance</th><td>None. Your guitar is already covered under my private policy.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2><span class="ship-step">Step 5</span> Get Paid Before You Leave</h2>
      <p>
        FedEx scans the label and hands you a drop-off receipt. Text me a photo of it. The moment I see
        that receipt, I send your payment.
      </p>

      <h2>Payment Options</h2>
      <p>Whichever you already trust: PayPal, Venmo, Zelle, Cash App, wire transfer, or a mailed check.</p>
      <p class="ship-note">
        Some apps cap how much you can receive per day or per transfer. On a larger sale, confirm your
        method with me in advance so the payment goes through in one shot.
      </p>

      <h2>Quick Reference Checklist</h2>
      <ul class="ship-check">
        <li>Email address sent</li>
        <li>Driver’s license photo sent (optional but recommended)</li>
        <li>Case packed tight, no bubble wrap</li>
        <li>Called ahead about a guitar box (press 7 to reach a person)</li>
        <li>Sign checked: it reads FedEx Office Print &amp; Ship Center, word for word</li>
        <li>Photo of the guitar on the counter texted to me</li>
        <li>FedEx account #{FEDEX_ACCT} given at the counter</li>
        <li>Cheapest shipping selected</li>
        <li>FedEx insurance declined</li>
        <li>Drop-off receipt photo texted to me</li>
        <li>Payment method confirmed in advance</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="ship-reviews__inline">
        Still deciding? <a href={hrefs.googleReviews} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the
        reviews from sellers who shipped their guitars exactly this way</a>.
      </p>

      <div class="ship-contact">
        <p><strong>Questions? Text me anytime.</strong></p>
        <p>
          Phone/Text: <a href={hrefs.tel}>{contact.phone}</a><br />
          Email: <a href={hrefs.mailto}>{contact.email}</a><br />
          Shipping Address: {SHIP_TO}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .ship-inner { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
  .ship-title-bar {
    background: var(--color-brand-rust-dark, #682412);
    padding: 180px 24px 48px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ship-title-bar h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 54px);
    color: var(--color-brand-cream);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .ship-body { background: #fff; padding: 44px 0 72px; }
  .ship-body p, .ship-body li {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-brand-charcoal);
  }
  .ship-body p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .ship-lede { font-size: 18px !important; }
  .ship-note { font-style: italic; }
  .ship-body a { color: var(--color-brand-rust); text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600; }
  .ship-body h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 24px;
    color: var(--color-brand-rust-dark);
    margin: 36px 0 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .ship-step {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--color-brand-rust-bright, #be4b25);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  /* Reviews CTA. Dark rust so it reads as the one clickable thing on the page
     and doesn't blend into the cream callout directly below it. */
  .ship-reviews {
    background: var(--color-brand-rust-dark, #682412);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ship-body .ship-reviews p {
    color: var(--color-brand-cream, #eedfc0);
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }
  .ship-reviews__lead {
    font-family: var(--font-display) !important;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 20px !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }
  .ship-body .ship-reviews__btn {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 12px;
    background: var(--color-brand-cream, #eedfc0);
    color: var(--color-brand-rust-dark, #682412);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 13px 24px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .ship-body .ship-reviews__btn:hover,
  .ship-body .ship-reviews__btn:focus-visible {
    background: #fff;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .ship-reviews__inline {
    background: var(--color-brand-cream-light, #f9f1de);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-brand-rust-bright);
    padding: 14px 18px;
    margin: 24px 0 0 !important;
  }
  .ship-callout {
    background: var(--color-brand-cream-light, #f9f1de);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-brand-rust-bright);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .ship-callout ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  .ship-callout li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .ship-warn {
    background: #f6e0da;
    border-left: 4px solid #842012;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #5a1a0d;
  }
  /* Exact-name callout. The store name is the single easiest thing for a seller
     to get wrong, so it gets its own block with the name set large and literal.
     Do NOT shorten it to "FedEx Print & Ship Center" — the word "Office" is what
     separates the real store from a FedEx Authorized ShipCenter. */
  .ship-exact {
    background: #f6e0da;
    border: 2px solid #842012;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ship-body .ship-exact p { color: #5a1a0d; margin: 0; }
  .ship-body .ship-exact__label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  /* p.<class> so the name beats the `.ship-body .ship-exact p` colour above it. */
  .ship-body .ship-exact p.ship-exact__name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(21px, 3.4vw, 30px);
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: #842012;
    margin: 8px 0 10px;
  }
  .ship-body .ship-exact__note {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .ship-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .ship-table th, .ship-table td {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 11px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(62, 42, 20, 0.12);
    color: var(--color-brand-charcoal);
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .ship-table th {
    width: 36%;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-brand-rust-dark);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .ship-check { list-style: none; margin: 0 0 18px; padding: 0; }
  .ship-check li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 9px;
  }
  .ship-check li::before {
    content: "✓";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    color: var(--color-brand-rust-bright);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .ship-contact {
    margin-top: 36px;
    background: var(--color-brand-cream, #eedfc0);
    padding: 20px 24px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .ship-contact p { margin: 0 0 8px; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .ship-title-bar { padding: 120px 16px 36px; }
    .ship-table th { white-space: normal; width: 40%; }
    .ship-reviews { padding: 20px 16px; }
    .ship-body .ship-reviews__btn { font-size: 14px; padding: 12px 18px; }
  }
</style>
